      "id": "claim_4cfc34d3bab1414fb11a5b9af932f173",
      "statement": "The most complete wired desktop GUI flow in the repository is under `noFrontEnd`: `entry.py` starts the account/login and disclaimer flow and calls `frontdef` after accepted login, while `front.py` routes exercise and statistics choices. This source-level path does not establish deployment or operational use.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://noFrontEnd/entry.py#L1-L69",
